<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>body{font-family:Arial;font-size:11pt} h1{font-size:16pt} h2{font-size:13pt} h3{font-size:12pt} pre{word-wrap:break-word} table{border-collapse:collapse} td,th{border:1px solid #000;padding:4px}</style></head><body><h1 style="text-align:center;border-bottom:3px double #000;padding-bottom:8px">Pertemuan 19 — </h1><p style="color:#666;font-size:9pt">Materi: - | JP: 2 | Mapel: Bahasa Indonesia</p><hr><h2 style="background:#111;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;margin:16px 0 8px">form_data</h2><pre style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border:1px solid #ddd">{
